    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是我即将开启的人生新副本的第一期播客，欢迎收听😘</span></p><p><strong><span>播客时间轴：</span></strong></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a>】开篇：上海宝妈蒋明珠的从业背景和生活近况</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a>】因Coldplay与香港友邦结缘</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a>】芳疗师身份如何结合保险代理？新身份带来的个人品牌升级创作思路</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a>】对保险代理职业从抗拒到接受的心路历程</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a>】香港工作IANG与其他类型签证申请</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a>】选择香港友邦而不是上海友邦的原因</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">24:21</a>】香港保险中介人执照考试报名事项及介绍</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">24:21</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">28:55</a>】结尾</span></p><p><span>🎵背景音乐：《Everglow》by Coldplay</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>播客中提到的美剧和台词截图：</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FutlPU_M3fQOf2YuIelucYBhwgWa.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnn8_mrLYwoq4KpMYH5br_NB5fyF.png"></figure><p></p><p><span>我的香港保险代理执照成绩单</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvGusX0WDN7U4w3iMgWVNA4KHRy_.jpeg"></figure><p></p><p><span>香港保险代理执照考试官网链接：</span></p><p><a href="https://www.peak.edu.hk/exam/tc/iiqe" data-url="https://www.peak.edu.hk/exam/tc/iiqe"><span>www.peak.edu.hk</span></a></p><p></p><p><span>香港保险考试科目一VS科目三</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlpMsSnIzGF2uDC-hSqxHfKTIUFp.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtMXsU37b3S154o9n6fD1e8uh83s.png"></figure><p><span>对芳疗学习和香港保险有兴趣的朋友，欢迎与我联络哦～</span></p>]]></description>
