    <guid isPermaLink="false">68200822b7c8a9962c763d13</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 May 2025 02:22:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客由「芳香下午茶」和</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67b3f1faf59735d21e2aa45c?s=eyJ1IjogIjY3YTIyNzE3ZjM2OWFhZjc5YTc3YzgxYyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67b3f1faf59735d21e2aa45c?s=eyJ1IjogIjY3YTIyNzE3ZjM2OWFhZjc5YTc3YzgxYyJ9"><span>「芳疗师联盟」</span></a><span>联合出品，是一次意料之外，却碰撞出了奇妙化学反应的录制。</span></p><span></span><p><span>原本「芳疗师联盟」的两位主播Christie和乔伊斯高计划了采访蒋明珠和苏小西作为「上海ebb&amp;flow 心流·身心芳疗」联合主理人实体店创业一年半的心路历程，哪知道约了好几个月还没约上…… 于是Christie先给自己安排了一次在ebb&amp;flow的SPA体验。恰巧蒋明珠和亚瑟当日也在店里录播课，所以我们临时起意，在不做任何准备的情况下，来了一场说干就干的脱口秀。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人生就是因为存在那么多意料之外的美好体验，才能在生命有限的长度里创造尽可能多的宽度吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>诚意邀请大家支持全新出品的芳疗节目→</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67b3f1faf59735d21e2aa45c?s=eyJ1IjogIjY3YTIyNzE3ZjM2OWFhZjc5YTc3YzgxYyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67b3f1faf59735d21e2aa45c?s=eyJ1IjogIjY3YTIyNzE3ZjM2OWFhZjc5YTc3YzgxYyJ9"><span>芳疗师联盟（点击直达）</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▶进度条君：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">00:01:39</a> 两位嘉宾亚瑟和Christie是何方神圣？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">00:14:42</a> 芳疗创业变现的4个有效途径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2042">00:34:02</a> 客观分析国内外主流精油品牌：Dr. Wong，多特瑞，梵溪花园及PRANARÖM</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2958">00:49:18</a> 刚入坑精油的良心建议：闭坑排雷省钱及安全用油，请和靠谱专业的国际认证芳疗师做朋友！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3717">01:01:57</a> 上海和杭州芳疗SPA实体店创业一手创业经验谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4636">01:17:16</a> 线下店铺嗅觉营销背后的医学逻辑，为什么嗅觉可能成为五感六觉中最具前（钱）景去重点营销的感官？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4965">01:22:45</a> 流行感冒病毒盛行的时代，如何通过家庭常备的几款精油轻松高效恢复暂时性嗅觉丧失，顺便对抗呼吸道炎症，提升抵抗力？</span></p><span></span><p><span>▶</span><strong><span>介绍一下两位嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Christie </span></strong><span>🍠账号：601915858</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhVMDFuctaerDxwMiXAdHy5X9KDJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>亚瑟🍠账号：8974438377</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FogxVp5lR7a2cwvBPjDyEewggmd9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▶BGM:&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP: <day one=""> Interstella Theme by Hans Zimmer 电影《星际穿越》主题曲Day One</day></span></p><span></span><p><span>ED: &lt;正解&gt; by RADWIMPS</span></p>]]></description>
