    <title>芳疗101▶️关于入坑芳疗你关心的那些事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/656db067e3f90e0c69ba01ea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">656db067e3f90e0c69ba01ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Dec 2023 10:56:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>越来越多的姐妹们和我一样已经爱上「芳疗」啦，今天芳疗小白粒粒酱和芳疗师苏小西一起来聊一聊你所关心的芳香话题。更多芳香宝藏内容，欢迎关注小红书账号：</span><a href="http://xhslink.com/sVxdex" data-url="http://xhslink.com/sVxdex"><span>苏小西的疗愈花园</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">3:01</a>:什么是芳疗，它和中西医之间有何关系？有哪些主要的应用方式？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a>苏小西被芳疗治愈的亲身经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a>中国芳疗行业现状，只是氪金的小众爱好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a>小白想入坑，有哪些高性价比的途径？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2516">41:56</a>冷静劝退：玩玩可以，入行需三思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2792">46:32</a>秋冬呼吸道敏感护理小Tip</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日Tips:</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 针对呼吸道感染引发的鼻塞和咳嗽：饮用白玉兰纯露</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 提升免疫力及放松舒缓的的按摩精油按摩：使用罗文莎叶（抗感染）、欧洲赤松（提升免疫力），薰衣草或罗马洋甘菊（安抚舒敏）混合后加入基础油</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP - Details in the Fabric, Jason Mraz ft. James Morrison</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED - Best of My Heart, Cujo Moon</span></p>]]></description>
